{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_4000_situation", "source_sha256": "2d0c45c2b191f32d60c027225516ba297a41c8f275a3d4331f6b56b4bf37925c", "ja": "フリーペーパーのコラム執筆", "zh": "免费小报的专栏执笔", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_4000_place", "source_sha256": "1cbe627c95de5a62bd5f39580d39db87faad3ab8a2240c69ec5ee7f3d604923f", "ja": "ファミレス", "zh": "家庭餐厅", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_4001_p", "source_sha256": "95a2732d64a3dae76849dc00924126b9b614322ae76baeda27ce746a822f44f5", "ja": "朋花、フリーぺーパーのコラムなんだけど、どうだ？\n〆切までに間に合いそうか？", "zh": "朋花，关于免费小报的专栏，现在怎么样了？\n赶得上截稿日吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_4002_031tom", "source_sha256": "2633052649e94cd201ec15a44954375f302bbda83863421a7e0c834a90ed970d", "ja": "もちろん、大丈夫ですよ～。\n聖母の言葉を、子豚ちゃん達が待っていますから～。", "zh": "当然没问题的～\n因为小猪们都在等待着圣母的话语啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_4003_031tom", "source_sha256": "98fa9a3685f64d00698ac25bd6b45e48793117510e3fe5ccef84bd801eb7a3e1", "ja": "もっとも、子豚ちゃん達は、私のどんな言葉でも、\n鳴いて喜んでしまうのですけれど……。", "zh": "不过无论我写什么，\n小猪们都会发出开心的鸣叫……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_4004_p", "source_sha256": "16bce018be0c6d32c7ce87bbeb0757cc3f02b890b471f0e83e58a1516a94f1d3", "ja": "そうか……複雑な悩みだな。", "zh": "是吗……真复杂的烦恼呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_4005_031tom", "source_sha256": "daf83b6a412d14b9cc109522351ea4144ec7bc8658e6579b08893df6a27f5eee", "ja": "はい。だから次は、何を書けばいいのかと、\n私も少々、頭を悩ませているところです～。", "zh": "是的，所以我正有点伤脑筋，\n不知道接下来该写什么才好呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_4006_031tom", "source_sha256": "e850c2a4c40604b7516d3c05802d41f87fa8c43656d1e509e5fb53c1b0341dd9", "ja": "ちなみに{$P$}さんは、\nどんなコラムを書くべきだと思いますか～？", "zh": "顺带一问，{$P$}先生，\n你觉得该写什么样的专栏呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_4007_p", "source_sha256": "04254ccd82c660e9121b46ff15e3db677a38944251a9873f6e3c02e361e8c99b", "ja": "子豚ちゃん達が、喜ぶコラムか。\nそうだな……。", "zh": "小猪们看了会开心的专栏吗？\n这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_4008", "source_sha256": "253836011292daad30d3123719bc0072487738b69836a167a7004319b21f9d0b", "ja": "癒しのメッセージ", "zh": "疗愈小语", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_4009", "source_sha256": "55198abeefeffacbdc7ccd03d70176d112aecee8e799d8d7ac65018b67881005", "ja": "朋花の日常", "zh": "朋花的日常生活", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_4010", "source_sha256": "e69d172e8ea17d871229e3aa2a40c694ff03fad06918afffd15e306f18434e47", "ja": "お得なランチ情報", "zh": "划算的午餐资讯", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_4100_p", "source_sha256": "da72b747dec071986b2643d490531cc247569fd7625697367486fa83cd04a1e7", "ja": "やっぱりファン……子豚ちゃん達が求めているのは、\n朋花の言葉……癒しの言葉だと思うな。", "zh": "我想粉丝……小猪们所追求的\n是朋花的话语……疗愈的话语吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_4101_031tom", "source_sha256": "7b9efc88f7511ebeec947cec07554e6eed06187c957c23953565bca128998bf2", "ja": "ふふっ、そうですね～。\nさすがは{$P$}さん、ですね～♪", "zh": "呵呵，你说得对～\n真不愧是{$P$}先生呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_4102_031tom", "source_sha256": "18551e26ddb8348f9a09be4c152d12f747d555ef33387eeb9a3df8effb78ce54", "ja": "私や子豚ちゃん達が求めていることを、\nよく理解していますね。ほめてさしあげましょう～。", "zh": "十分理解我和小猪们追求的是什么呢，\n让我来好好夸奖你吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_4103_031tom", "source_sha256": "3385e7bdc4b983f72b74f0f391395e77eef4f337b5402a54d815bb8f7ed87c33", "ja": "今の答えには、満点をつけてあげます～。\nこれからもその調子で、お願いしますね～♪", "zh": "今天的回答，帮你打一百分～\n接下来也请维持这种状态啰～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_4200_p", "source_sha256": "3244697d01caced9fdd3e23fef208e04d042b685126c21443d099c8d0614e85b", "ja": "みんなが知りたいのは、朋花の日常じゃないかな？\n朋花のことを、より知りたいというか……。", "zh": "大家想知道的是朋花的日常生活吧？\n该说是想多了解朋花吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_4201_031tom", "source_sha256": "552595c2a38a555b22aec1a7798d8f7ec12ac42fdf256840e8c29832ec6dd352", "ja": "あら……\n惜しいですね、{$P$}さん～。", "zh": "哎呀……\n真可惜呢，{$P$}先生～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_4202_031tom", "source_sha256": "1b9625bfbec2165db39d21f352891648749e0d49d8eb9f0afa42a60e1cced857", "ja": "聖母に、秘密なんてありませんよ～。すべての\n子豚ちゃん達は、みな聖母の前に平等ですから～。", "zh": "圣母是没有秘密的喔～\n所有的小猪们，在圣母面前都是平等的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_4203_031tom", "source_sha256": "44e93d9dd74f3b750536115a39f6daf3223ec61ab633b6d72d009f4e0a43b950", "ja": "でも、なかなかいい回答でした～。うふふ、\n{$P$}さんは見込みがありますね～♪", "zh": "但这回答还算不错～呵呵。\n{$P$}先生真有前途呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_4300_p", "source_sha256": "cfb529687477af36f2d73e86a58e7826a83322101dd63d9d0eb96ba4755016aa", "ja": "朋花おススメ、お得なランチ情報なんてどうだ？\nグルメ系の話題は、鉄板だし……。", "zh": "朋花推荐的划算午餐资讯怎么样？\n毕竟美食类的话题是不会出错的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_4301_031tom", "source_sha256": "f651d92c6b7a1a886610d9320cc2b836af8d422a89f7be090310abfc2b303c62", "ja": "……うふふ♪　{$P$}さん～？\nもう少し、頭を使って発言してくださいね～？", "zh": "……呵呵♪{$P$}先生～\n发言之前，请多用一点脑袋喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_4302_031tom", "source_sha256": "16418ab762a712f9e8995ba329eb0456d1e05658618485249544540ec3b87f5e", "ja": "それにそういう情報は、フリーペーパーの\n他のページで、十分間に合うのではありませんか～？", "zh": "而且这类资讯，用免费小报的\n其他页数写就已经很足够了吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_4303_p", "source_sha256": "634e13b8b2cd84bbd5515883d8c3132450ff21feed0ff0979aa2537ed4b7c1d9", "ja": "え？　そ、そうかな。\n俺だったら嬉しいけど……。", "zh": "咦？是、是这样吗？\n要是我看了会很高兴就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_4304_031tom", "source_sha256": "4eb6a1b5bc3446776e74a309cb34a656f26d111b25e8307d24a828d23b843230", "ja": "まったく……\nまだまだ、ダメプロデューサーですね～。", "zh": "真是的……\n依然是个无能制作人呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
